      The `makeMcpJson` helper stays the same shape (it serializes a
      `{ command, args }` entry under `mcpServers.brain`).

      Test cases — each in its own `describe` block, named with the
      step letter for traceability:

      - 3a. **`ok` — brain.aide parses, .mcp.json matches exactly.**
        Write a brain.aide with default args (inline path, no
        placeholders). Write a `.mcp.json` whose `mcpServers.brain`
