        Assert no `name`, `rootPath`, `connector`, or `backend`
        properties on the result.

      - 3c. **`no-brain-aide` (frontmatter malformed).** Write a
        brain.aide whose YAML is broken (e.g. unclosed bracket). Assert
        `result.status === "no-brain-aide"`. Same shape assertions as
        3b — only `status` and `hints`.

      - 3d. **`no-brain-aide` (body malformed — no `## Prose` heading).**
        Write a brain.aide with valid two-field frontmatter but no
